Connecting to the Database
Using DBeaver (or any MySQL client)
Open DBeaver or any other MySQL client.
Choose New Database Connection.
Select MySQL.

In the connection window, enter the following details:
Host: database-1.cdyqsq4eynri.us-east-2.rds.amazonaws.com
Database: Project_3
Port: 3306
Username: admin
Password: Data607_Project3
Click Test Connection to ensure you can connect.
Once successful, click Finish to save the connection.